      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COBBLE HILL (5) is progressing well and looks close to another win after hitting the frame last run (29.54) at this track. Solid record here including two wins. Makes plenty of appeal. PAW CHRISTIE (3) is having her first look at this course. Comes here an impressive winner latest at Sale in a Grade 5 in one of the quickest times of the program (28.92). Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Has definite claims. LADY RAPID (1) turned spotting a big start finishing fifth (30.31) last time in a Mix 3/4 at The Meadows. Form at the trip sound including three wins. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from six starts. Has ability and is one of the better chances. ELLIS UNIT ONE (7) was in the money again last time and not beaten far when second (25.39) at Ballarat in a Grade 4/5.",
